   That is the whole loop. To land a change:

   [2m1.[0m Run the checks:
     [2m┌ sh ─────────────┐[0m
     [2m│[0m deno task check [2m│[0m
     [2m└─────────────────┘[0m
   [2m2.[0m Commit on [34mmain[39m once every check has passed and the tree is clean, so
     whoever picks the work up next starts from a build that runs.

   Then build the binary with:

   [2m┌ sh ─────────────────────────────────────────────────┐[0m
   [2m│[0m deno task compile --all                             [2m│[0m
   [2m│[0m [35mfor[39m bin [35min[39m dist/*/chord; [35mdo[39m [36mecho[39m [33m"built $bin"[39m; [35mdone[39m [2m│[0m
